y the National Council for Teacher Education (NCTE) and is affiliated with the Tamil Nadu Teachers Education University, ensuring a curriculum that meets modern pedagogical standards.\\n\\nThe campus spans 9 acres and provides a serene yet intellectually stimulating environment for student teachers. With modern classrooms, specialized science and psychology laboratories, and a rich library, the institution supports comprehensive learning. The college emphasizes the ''Progress Through Perfection'' philosophy, fostering essential teaching skills through consistent internships, micro-teaching sessions, and professional guidance to ensure graduates are well-prepared for the competitive education sector.","highlights":["NCTE Recognized Institution","Affiliated to TNTEU","Strategic Location on State Highway","Experienced Faculty Mentorship","Focus on Micro-Teaching Skills","Well-Stocked Pedagogical Library","Active School Internship Network","Modern ICT-Enabled Classrooms","Strong Focus on Value-Based Education","Dedicated Career Guidance Cell"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Ed","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-book","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Fleet"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Science & Tech Labs"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Complex"},{"icon":"ti-user","name":"Student Counseling"},{"icon":"ti-printer","name":"Reprography Unit"},{"icon":"ti-medallie","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-thought","name":"Reading Room"}],"placementRate":76,"avgPackage":"₹1.8 LPA","highestPackage":"₹3.2 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Submit applications as per TNTEU guidelines."},{"title":"Eligibility Verification","desc":"Checking academic qualifications and degree certificates."},{"title":"Counseling Participation","desc":"Candidates participate in state-level seat allotment."},{"title":"Document Authentication","desc":"Verification of original certificates by the college office."},{"title":"Final Enrollment","desc":"Confirmation of admission through fee payment and orientation."}],"scholarships":["SC/ST Post-Matric Scholarship","BC/MBC Scholarship","Minority Scholarship","First Graduate Concession","Institutional Merit Aid"],"events":["Annual Sports Meet","Teachers Day Celebration","Literary Fest","School Internship Program","Cultural Talent Show"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"125 km","railway":"8 km","bustand":"12 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"4 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Safe Accommodation","24/7 Security","Nutritious Mess","Wi-Fi Enabled","Study Halls"],"technicalClubs":["ICT & Digital Literacy Club","Science Forum"],"culturalClubs":["Arts & Fine Arts Club","Literary Association"],"communityService":["Rural Literacy Drives","Environmental Awareness Campaigns"]}'),
