ous architecture institutions in India, established in 1957. It functions as a constituent department of Anna University and is approved by the Council of Architecture (COA), New Delhi. The institution has a strong legacy of producing skilled architects, planners, and researchers who contribute significantly to the built environment sector.\\n\\nSAP offers undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs in architecture and planning with a strong emphasis on design thinking, sustainability, urban development, and environmental planning. The campus is equipped with advanced design studios, computer-aided design labs, material testing facilities, and model-making workshops. With experienced faculty and strong academic-industry collaboration, SAP provides students with excellent exposure to real-world architectural challenges and urban development projects.","highlights":["Premier Government Architecture Institution","COA Approved Architecture Programs","Advanced Design & CAD Studios","Strong Urban Planning Curriculum","Experienced Faculty & Research Guidance","Sustainable Design Focus","Industry Collaboration with Leading Firms","Internship Opportunities in Top Studios","Strong Alumni Network in Architecture Sector","Research in Urban & Environmental Planning","Hands-on Design Studio Learning"],"departments":[{"name":"Bachelor of Architecture (B.Arch)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Master of Architecture (M.Arch - Landscape Architecture)","level":"PG"},{"name":"Master of Architecture (M.Arch - Urban Design)","level":"PG"},{"name":"Master of Architecture (M.Arch - Environmental Architecture)","level":"PG"},{"name":"Master of Planning (M.Plan)","level":"PG"},{"name":"PhD in Architecture & Planning","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wide Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Architecture Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Material Testing Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-c