dant campus, the college features state-of-the-art laboratories, modern lecture halls, and a massive teaching hospital equipped with cutting-edge medical technologies including MRI, CT scan, and advanced ICUs. The hospital acts as a major healthcare provider for Vellore and neighboring districts, ensuring rich clinical exposure for students.\\n\\nWith distinguished faculty members, robust academic programs, and active student societies, GVMC fosters holistic growth. The institution emphasizes moral values, scientific inquiry, and community healthcare engagement, producing competent medical professionals who excel globally.","highlights":["Established in 2005 with NMC recognition","Affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Sprawling 120-acre modern campus in Adukkamparai, Vellore","Equipped with advanced diagnostic tools like MRI and CT scan","Recognized among top emerging medical institutions in India","Highly experienced faculty across clinical and non-clinical disciplines","Comprehensive central library with an extensive digital database","Separate hostel facilities for undergraduate and postgraduate students","Active student-run cultural, literary, and sports associations","Strong emphasis on rural healthcare and community outreach"],"departments":[{"name":"General Medicine","level":"PG"},{"name":"General Surgery","level":"PG"},{"name":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Paediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Orthopaedics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Emergency Medicine","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb"