 modern lecture halls, advanced laboratories, a comprehensive central library, and state-of-the-art research centers. The attached teaching hospital handles massive patient volumes daily, providing students with unmatched exposure to diverse clinical cases across various medical and surgical disciplines. Guided by a distinguished faculty, GKMC fosters a culture of compassion, ethics, and scientific inquiry.\\n\\nBeyond academics, the institution encourages students to engage in cultural events, sports, and community outreach programs, ensuring holistic development. Graduates from Kilpauk Medical College serve successfully in leading hospitals, research organizations, and public health sectors worldwide, cementing its reputation as a cornerstone of medical education in India.","highlights":["Prime location in the heart of Chennai city","Affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","High patient inflow providing unmatched clinical exposure","Experienced and dedicated faculty members","Well-stocked central library with digital access","Active student research and ICMR projects","Robust internship and house surgencies","Comprehensive modern labs and diagnostic centers","Active cultural and sports student committees","Strong alumni network across global healthcare institutions"],"departments":[{"name":"General Medicine","level":"PhD"},{"name":"General Surgery","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Paediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Obstetrics and Gynaecology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Orthopaedics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ophthalmology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Radiology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Anesthesiology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon"