akshi College of Allied Health Sciences - CollegeShine","description":"Meenakshi College of Allied Health Sciences is a private trust allied health science college in Madurai, Tamil Nadu established in 2011. Empowering Future.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Meenakshi-College-of-Allied-Health-Sciences-Madurai_72_11zon-150x150.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Meenakshi College of Allied Health Sciences - CollegeShine","description":"Meenakshi College of Allied Health Sciences is a private trust allied health science college in Madurai, Tamil Nadu established in 2011. Empowering Future.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Meenakshi-College-of-Allied-Health-Sciences-Madurai_72_11zon-150x150.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Meenakshi College of Allied Health Sciences","shortName":"MCAHS Madurai","tagline":"Empowering Future Healthcare Professionals with Precision and Compassion","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private","ownership":"Private Trust","established":2011,"location":"Madurai, Tamil Nadu","district":"Madurai","address":"Meenakshi Mission Hospital and Research Centre, Lake Area, Melur Road, Madurai, Tamil Nadu - 625107","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Meenakshi+College+of+Allied+Health+Sciences+Madurai","mapQuery":"Meenakshi College of Allied Health Sciences Madurai","website":"https://www.mcahs.in","phone":"+91 452 2588755","email":"principalmmhrc2@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Meenakshi-College-of-Allied-Health-Sciences-Madurai_72_11zon-150x150.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","accreditation":["The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","S.R. Trust Managed Institution","NABL Accredited Diagnostic Labs Exposure","Government of Ta