sium","MMHRC Clinical Skill Fest","World Laboratory Technicians Day","Inter-College Cultural Meet","Health Camp Outreach","Graduation and Oath-Taking Ceremony"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Madurai International Airport - 15 km","railway":"Madurai Junction Railway Station - 8 km","bustand":"Mattuthavani Integrated Bus Stand - 3 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"Meenakshi Mission Hospital - On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate secure hostel buildings for boys and girls","24-hour security with biometric access control","Hygienic mess providing wholesome vegetarian and non-vegetarian food","Wi-Fi network enabled study zones","Recreation rooms with television and indoor games","Regular power backup and purified drinking water","On-campus medical assistance through MMHRC emergency services","Clean laundry and housekeeping maintenance"],"technicalClubs":["Allied Health Research Forum","Diagnostics and Pathology Guild","Critical Care Technology Club","Biomedical Innovation Circle"],"culturalClubs":["Fine Arts and Craft Club","Music Band and Vocal Group","Dance Ensemble","Literary and Oratorical Club"],"communityService":["Free Diagnostic Health Camps in Rural Madurai","Blood Donation Camps in coordination with MMHRC","Health and Hygiene Awareness Rallies","First Aid Demonstration Programs in Schools","Elderly Welfare Home Support Visits","Environmental Awareness Clean-up Drives"]}')
