28303","email":"info@mapims.org","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Melmaruvathur-Adhiparasakthi-Institute-of-Medical-Sciences-and-Research-Kancheepuram_74_11zon-288x300.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","accreditation":["National Medical Commission (NMC)","The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Adhiparasakthi Charitable Medical, Educational and Cultural Trust","Government of Tamil Nadu Recognized"],"about":"Melmaruvathur Adhiparasakthi Institute of Medical Sciences and Research (MAPIMS), founded in 2008, is situated on a sprawling 45.75-acre campus along the Chennai-Trichy National Highway (NH-45) in Chengalpattu district (formerly Kancheepuram). Managed by the Adhiparasakthi Charitable Medical, Educational and Cultural Trust, the institution is affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC).\\n\\nThe attached multi-specialty teaching hospital features over 700 beds and handles a high daily outpatient volume, offering comprehensive clinical training across diverse departments. MAPIMS is committed to delivering exceptional medical education, fostering advanced clinical research, and instilling compassionate healthcare values in every student pursuing undergraduate and postgraduate medical degrees.\\n\\nEquipped with state-of-the-art laboratories, an extensive central library, modern lecture theatres, and dedicated residential facilities, MAPIMS creates an ideal atmosphere for intellectual growth and professional development. Graduates from MAPIMS excel in medical practice, research, and postgraduate residencies globally.","highlights":["Approved by National Medical Commission (NMC) and affiliated with TN MGR Medical University","Sprawling 45.75-acre modern campus on Chennai-Trichy National Highway","Multi-specialty teaching hospital with over 700 beds and high patient inflow","Experienced and dedicated facult