d across a sprawling 60-acre green campus on the Chennai-Trichy Highway, the institution is dedicated to offering world-class medical education, cutting-edge research, and accessible healthcare services. Affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC), the college attracts top-tier talent from across the country.\\n\\nThe 1000-bed multi-specialty teaching hospital attached to the college provides students with an extensive array of clinical case studies and hands-on patient care experience. The campus features ultra-modern lecture theaters, high-tech simulation centers, comprehensively equipped research laboratories, and a central library housing an exhaustive collection of national and international medical literature. The faculty comprises highly distinguished doctors, researchers, and academicians dedicated to mentoring medical students.\\n\\nSRM Trichy Medical College strongly emphasizes research and evidence-based medicine, encouraging students to participate in national medical conferences and publish in indexed journals. Beyond academics, the campus offers a vibrant student life with massive sports arenas, comfortable hostel accommodations, and various student-run clubs. Graduates from Trichy SRM are recognized globally for their clinical competence, ethical practices, and leadership in the medical community.","highlights":["1000-bed multi-specialty teaching hospital","Approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC)","State-of-the-art Clinical Skill Simulation Center","Eminent faculty with extensive medical expertise","Comprehensive central library with digital subscriptions","Strong emphasis on undergraduate and postgraduate research","24/7 emergency and trauma care training","Excellent campus infrastructure with extensive sports facilities","Global alumni network in top medical institutions","Regular CMEs and international medical conferences"],"departments":[{"name":"MBBS","level":"UG"},{