n":"St. Joseph''s College (Arts & Science) is a private self-financing arts & science college in Kundrathur Main Road, Kovur, Chennai - 600128 established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/st-joseph-college-of-arts-and-science-catering-cuddalore.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"St. Joseph''s College (Arts & Science) | Chennai - CollegeShine","description":"St. Joseph''s College (Arts & Science) is a private self-financing arts & science college in Kundrathur Main Road, Kovur, Chennai - 600128 established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/st-joseph-college-of-arts-and-science-catering-cuddalore.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"St. Joseph''s College (Arts & Science)","shortName":"SJC Kovur","tagline":"Educate To Excel through quality education, discipline and holistic development","category":"arts-science","type":"Autonomous Arts and Science College","ownership":"Private Self-Financing","established":1994,"location":"Kundrathur Main Road, Kovur, Chennai - 600128","district":"Chennai","address":"Kundrathur Main Road, Kovur, Chennai - 600128, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=St.+Joseph''s+College+Arts+Science+Kovur+Chennai+600128","mapQuery":"St. Joseph''s College Arts Science, Kundrathur Main Road, Kovur, Chennai - 600128, Tamil Nadu","website":"https://stjosephcollege.ac.in/","phone":"044-24780137 / 9444906893","email":"sjckovur@stjosephcollege.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/st-joseph-college-of-arts-and-science-catering-cuddalore.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_Zf2EHnFaeU?si=8TXQaXWqPxVd4pB1","affiliation":"University of Madras","accreditation":["NAAC Accredited - A Grade","UGC 2(f) Status","Government of Tamil Nadu Approved","University of Madras Affiliated","ISO 21001:2018 Certified Institution"],"about":"St. Joseph''s College (Arts & Science) is a co-educational Christian institution established in 1994 and managed by the Society for Education for Life. The institution was taken over and managed by DMI Sisters from 2004 under the leadership of Rev.Fr.Dr.J.E.Arul Raj OMI, Founder and Chairman. The college aims to provide disciplined, value-based and technically oriented education while supporting the holistic development of students. It is approved by the Government of Tamil Nadu, affiliated to the University of Madras, accredited by NAAC with an A Grade in the first cycle, recognised under Section 2(f) of the UGC Act, 1956 and ISO certified.\\n\\nThe college offers undergraduate and postgraduate programmes in Commerce, Computer Applications, Business Administration, English, Philosophy, Biotechnology, Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics with Computer Applications, Visual Communication, Hotel & Catering Management, Data Science and Artificial Intelligence, along with postgraduate programmes in Computer Science, Philosophy, Social Work and Commerce. The institution also provides library, transport, hostel, canteen, computer and academic facilities and operates a dedicated Training and Placement Cell with campus recruitment, career guidance, skill-development and industry-oriented programmes.","highlights":["Established in 1994","Co-educational Christian institution","Managed by Society for Education for Life","Managed by DMI Sisters since 2004","NAAC A Grade accreditation","UGC 2(f) status","Affiliated to University of Madras","ISO certified institution","UG and PG programmes","Training and Placement Cell","Hostel facilities for male and female students","Computerized central library"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Com","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com Accounting & Finance","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A English","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A Philosophy","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Biotechnology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.C.A Computer Applications","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Hotel & Catering Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Physics with Computer Application","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Visual Communication","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science with Data Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science with Artificial Intelligence","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Sc Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.A Philosophy","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.S.W Social Work","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Com","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-cup","name":"Canteen"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Medical Support"},{"icon":"ti-users","name":"Student Support Services"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Technology Enabled Learning"}],"placementRate":"Available","avgPackage":"Available","highestPackage":"Available","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application","desc":"Candidates can apply through the college admission process for the selected undergraduate or postgraduate programme."},{"title":"Eligibility Verification","desc":"Applicants must satisfy the programme-specific eligibility requirements prescribed by the college and University of Madras."},{"title":"Academic Screening","desc":"Applications are reviewed based on the prescribed academic qualification and programme eligibility."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Selected candidates complete verification of academic and other required admission documents."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Confirm