ple, and the college moved there in 1971.\\n\\nIt received permanent recognition under sections 2(f) and 12(B) of the UGC Act in 1971 and was awarded a B+ grade by NAAC after a 2005 assessment. The college is affiliated to Thiruvalluvar University, Vellore, and serves students from a roughly 40 km radius around Vridhachalam taluk, offering education free of cost as per Tamil Nadu government norms.\\n\\nA shift system was introduced in 2007 to expand access, and the college now offers around 10 undergraduate and 7 postgraduate programmes, including research opportunities in Tamil literature.","highlights":["Data not available"],"departments":[{"name":"Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"Bio-Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"Tamil","level":"PG"},{"name":"English","level":"UG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"}],"placementRate":null,"avgPackage":"Data not available","highestPackage":"Data not available","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application","desc":"Obtain and submit the application form through the college or affiliating university admissions portal."},{"title":"Eligibility Check","desc":"Meet the minimum qualifying marks in the relevant Higher Secondary stream as prescribed by the affiliating university."},{"title":"Merit List / Counselling","desc":"Admission is generally merit-based on qualifying exam marks, per Tamil Nadu government norms for the college category."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit original mark sheets, transfer certificate, community certificate (if applicable) and other required documents."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Confirmation","desc":"Pay the prescribed fees to 