('krishnasamy-college-science-arts-management-women-cuddalore','krishnasamy-college-science-arts-management-women-cuddalore','Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and Management for Women','KCSAM','arts-science','Arts and Science College for Women','Private Self-Financing','2007','Anand Nagar, Nellikuppam Main Road, S. Kumarapuram, Cuddalore - 607109','Cuddalore','Anand Nagar, Nellikuppam Main Road, S. Kumarapuram, Cuddalore - 607109, Tamil Nadu','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Krishnasamy+College+of+Science,+Arts+and+Management+for+Women,+Anand+Nagar,+Nellikuppam+Main+Road,+S.Kumarapuram,+Cuddalore+-+607109,+Tamil+Nadu','https://www.kcsam.in','04142-285751, 04142-285752, 04142-285753','info@kcsam.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Krishnasamy-College-of-Science-Arts-and-Management-for-Women-Cuddalore_49_11zon.webp','Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and - CollegeShine','Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and Management for Women is a private self-financing arts & science college in Anand Nagar, Nellikuppam Main Road, S.',NULL, '{"id":"krishnasamy-college-science-arts-management-women-cuddalore","seo":{"metaTitle":"Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and Management for Women is a private self-financing arts & science college in Anand Nagar, Nellikuppam Main Road, S.","metaKeywords":["Krishnasamy College of Science","Arts and Management for Women","KCSAM","Krishnasamy College of Science","Arts and Management for Women admission 2026","Krishnasamy College of Science","Arts and Management for Women fees","Krishnasamy College of Science","Arts and Management for Women courses","Arts & Science colleges in Cuddalore","Anand Nagar","Nellikuppam Main Road","S. Kumarapuram","Cuddalore - 607109","Cuddalore","Arts & Science","Private Self-Financing","Arts and Science College for Women","NAAC Accredited - Cycle 1","NAAC Grade B","NAAC CGPA 2.29","UGC Recognis