m Main Road, S.Kumarapuram, Cuddalore - 607109, Tamil Nadu","website":"https://www.kcsam.in","phone":"04142-285751, 04142-285752, 04142-285753","email":"info@kcsam.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Krishnasamy-College-of-Science-Arts-and-Management-for-Women-Cuddalore_49_11zon.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VMUsbMXdfkw?si=Q9gjpXBNCty1t79E","affiliation":"Thiruvalluvar University, Vellore","accreditation":["NAAC Accredited - Cycle 1","NAAC Grade B","NAAC CGPA 2.29","UGC Recognised under Section 2(f)","Affiliated to Thiruvalluvar University","Government of Tamil Nadu Recognised"],"about":"Krishnasamy College of Science, Arts and Management for Women was established in 2007 by Sri Krishnasamy Reddiar Educational Trust with the vision of empowering women through quality higher education. The institution is located at Anand Nagar on Nellikuppam Main Road, S. Kumarapuram, Cuddalore, and is affiliated to Thiruvalluvar University, Vellore. The college is recognised under Section 2(f) of the UGC Act and received its first NAAC accreditation in 2019 with Grade B and a CGPA of 2.29.\\n\\nThe institution provides undergraduate and postgraduate education across Arts, Science, Commerce, Management and Computer-related disciplines. Its infrastructure includes an 11.6-acre campus, academic and administrative blocks, science laboratories, computer facilities, central library, digital learning resources, smart classrooms, auditorium, seminar halls, hostel, transport, gymnasium, canteen, bank and sports facilities. The college also maintains student-development initiatives through NSS, Youth Red Cross, Red Ribbon Club, ECO Club, Anti-Drug Club, Women Empowerment Cell, IPR Cell, Placement Cell, IIC and research-development activities.","highlights":["Established in 2007","Women''s Higher Education Institution","11.6-Acre Campus","Thiruvalluvar University Affiliation","UGC 2(f) Recognition","NAAC Accredited","NAAC Grade B","2.29 NAAC CGPA"