l-stocked library, and functional laboratories designed to support hands-on learning. By integrating traditional curriculum with modern pedagogical approaches, GASC Gingee ensures that students are equipped with both domain-specific knowledge and essential life skills. The institution actively encourages participation in extracurricular activities, sports, and community outreach programs, making it a hub for holistic development.\\n\\nWith a focus on inclusive education, the college provides various government scholarship schemes to support students from marginalized sections. The placement cell works continuously to connect students with regional and national employers, facilitating a smooth transition from academia to the workforce.","highlights":["Affordable government fee structure","Well-qualified faculty members","Focus on rural student development","Active NSS and NCC units","Scholarship-friendly environment","Library with digital access","Regular industrial visits","State-of-the-art computer lab","Safe and secure campus environment","Strong alumni network"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PG"},{"name":"English","level":"PG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":60,"avgPackage":"2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"4.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application","desc":"Submit application via the official TN governm